#. Tag: title
#: development.docbook:2372
#, no-c-format
msgid "Editor Component Extensions"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: development.docbook:2374
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<link linkend=\"editor-component-plugins\">Editor Component Extensions</"
"link> extend KatePart, the Advanced Text Editor component used within many "
"&kde; applications, such as &kate;, &kwrite;, Kile, and KDevelop. Creating "
"an Editor Component Plugin will allow you to extend the editor's "
"functionality in any and all of these programs."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: development.docbook:2380
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"To get started, see the <ulink url=\"http://techbase.kde.org/Development/"
"Tutorials/Kate/KTextEditor_Plugins\"> KTextEditor Plugin Tutorial on &kde; "
"TechBase</ulink>. For even more, see the <ulink url=\"http://techbase.kde."
"org/Development/Tutorials/Kate/KTextEditor_Plugins_Advanced\"> Advanced "
"Tutorial, also on TechBase</ulink>."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: development.docbook:2386
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"You can find the <ulink url=\"http://api.kde.org/4.10-api/kdelibs-apidocs/"
"interfaces/ktexteditor/html/\"> complete API documentation in the &kde; API "
"Reference</ulink>."
msgstr ""

